# Google OAuth Configuration
# Replace with your actual Google Client ID from Google Cloud Console
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=117222477417-p31qenhelhmdpe64unci83s0cequ0rna.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Instructions to get Google Client ID:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable Google+ API
# 4. Go to Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth 2.0 Client IDs
# 5. Set Application type to "Web application"
# 6. Add your domain to Authorized JavaScript origins (e.g., http://localhost:5173)
# 7. Copy the Client ID and replace the value above